body:
This is EnderKits! A Minecraft Mod that helps you make kits (similar to Client Kits) to save kits in your Ender Chest!

Commands:

/eck save {name}

(Saves the kit)

/eck load {name}

(Loads the kit that you saved)

/eck delete {name}

(Deletes the kit you chose to delete.)

If there are any bugs, contact Morseful on discord and I will get on it right away!
